[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Heracles Internal GUI SW Verification Test Protocol
UID: DHF-HRC-0038-TP
METADATA:
  COMPONENT: heracles-internal-gui

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @grammar

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Purpose

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
This document provides the verification test protocol and execution results of the Internal GUI SW for the Heracles 1.0 system. It defines the test cases that are used to verify the compliance of the software with the Heracles Internal GUI SW Verification Plan and Software Requirements Specification.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Scope

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
This document details all test cases for the Verification testing activities of Heracles 1.0 Internal GUI Software. Each test case is designed to verify specific functional, interface, and usability requirements of the system.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Abbreviations and Definitions

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
FW
Firmware

HVPS
High Voltage Power Supply

SDP
Software Development Plan

SVP
Software Verification Plan

SW
Software

GUI
Graphical User Interface

EMR
Electronic Medical Records

DB
Database

QC
Quality Control

MRN
Medical Record Number

PID
Proportional Integral Derivative

MCU
Microcontroller Unit
<<<

