[TEST_CASE]
UID: TC-H10SG-181
TITLE: EMR: Patient's Registration form - Layout - Test Case
STATEMENT: >>>
This test case verifies the layout and user interface components of the EMR: Patient's Registration form. It validates that all UI elements are properly displayed and arranged according to specifications.
<<<
STEPS: >>>
1.Launch Heracles internal SW 

2.Navigate to the "Patients" tab. 

3.Click the "New patient" button at the bottom of the screen.
<<<
EXPECTED_BEHAVIOR: >>>
3.The new patient registration form should open on the left side of the screen, providing the option to input the patient's demographic data, 
the form should include the following fields: 

• First Name 

• Middle Name 

• Last name 

• Date of birth 

• MRN\ID (SSN or other) 

• Sex 

• Zip Code 

• Patient’s Demographic Notes
<<<
