[TEST_CASE]
UID: TC-H10SG-323
TITLE: Quality Assurance Report - DB Connection Error - Test Case
STATEMENT: >>>
Verify that the application presents the user with a warning message when the retrieval of quality checks history report fails due to a communication error with the database. The message should ask the user to retry after a few seconds.
<<<
PREREQUISITES: >>>
1. This test case requires the ability to intentionally create a communication error with the database. 

2. Create quality assurance tests in the application prior to this test.
<<<
STEPS: >>>
Test steps: 

1. Launch and login Heracles internal application 

2. Create an intended communication error with the database to prevent it from quality assurance history data. 

3. Click the Quality Assurance menu item.
<<<
EXPECTED_BEHAVIOR: >>>
The application shall present the user with a warning message when the retrieval of Quality assurance history fails due to a communication 
error with the database. The message should ask the user to retry after a few seconds.
<<<
