• Current permission states displayed 

• Clicking an unchecked checkbox sets the permission (checkbox becomes checked) 

• Clicking a checked checkbox unsets the permission (checkbox becomes unchecked) 

• Multiple permissions can be modified before saving 

• The Save button successfully saves all permission changes 

• Permission changes persist after navigation and application restart 

• Users with modified roles experience appropriate access control (enabled/disabled features match permissions)
<<<
