[TEST_CASE]
UID: TC-H10SG-322
TITLE: EMR: Clinical view - Add Treatment Fields to a plan - Calculate the Actual Dose - Test Case
STATEMENT: >>>
This test case verifies the creation and addition of new items in the system. It validates the complete workflow from initiation through successful data persistence.
<<<
STEPS: >>>
1.Launch and login Heracles internal 

2.Click the Setting tab 

3.Click the Target Management tab 

4.Click new Target. 

5.Inside the opened window fill in the following: 

Type: 50MM_SSD_13_FIELDS(choose from the drop-down menu) 

Active: mark as active 

1. Click the save button. 

7.Click the Calibration tab (on the left panel) 

8.Click the Collimator Type and select 50MM_SSD_13_FIELDSfrom the drop-down menu. 

9.Click the Output Factor Configuration 

10.In the collimator view click 13 

11.In the highlighted 13 row click the row under Factor column 

12.Enter 1.05 to set output Factor 

13.Navigate to the patients tab 

14. Verify that a patient with the following details exists in the system or create a new patient by pressing "New patient" and filing 
the following details: 

• First Name: FirstNameTest 

• Middle Name: MiddleNameTest 

• Last Name: LastNameTest 

• Sex: Male 

• DOB: 01/01/1980 

• MRN:12345 

15. Click the "Save Patient" button at the bottom of the registration form. 

16. In the patients list view, click twice on the newly created patient. 

17.Navigate to "Plan" tab and click the "Add" button at the bottom of the plan tab on the bottom left corner of the screen. 

18. Fill in the following details: 

• Site Name: testSite 

• Pathology: testPathology 

19. Click the "Save" button. 

20. In the same plan tab under "Simulation" click the "Add" button. 

21.Fill in the following details for "Simulation": 

\*Lesion Size[cm]:1.00 x 1.00 

\*Margin Size[cm]:1.00 

\*Shield Size [cm]: 1.00 

\*Lesion Depth [mm]: 1.00 

\*Position: Prone (Select from the Position drop-down menu) 

\*Device :HeadHolder (select HeadHolder from the drop-down menu) 

22.Click the "Save" button under "Simulation". 

23.In the same plan tab, click the "Add" button under "Prescription". 

24. File in the following details: 

Dose Pre Fx [cGy]: 200 

TDF: 100(select from the drop-down menu) 

Fx per week: Select 1 from the drop-down menu. 

Number of Fx: 1 

Energy [kV]: 50 (Select from the drop-down menu) 

25. At the bottom of the same screen, select treatment field 13 in the visual control representing the connected collimator and select 
Duration 60. 

26. Click add, to add treatment fields.
<<<
EXPECTED_BEHAVIOR: >>>
The Actual Dose should be auto-calculate from the duration using the following function: 

[Field Output factor] * [Dose Rate cGy/min] * Duration / 60 

i.e. 1.05 * 200* 60/ 60 = 210 

The Actual dose should appear under Actual Dose column for the relevant treatment field.
<<<
