STEPS: >>>
1. Navigate to the Patients tab. 

1. Double-click the predefined patient to open its Simulation View. 

1. 

In the Simulation sub-tab, select the predefined simulation. 

1. Locate the Prescription section (e.g., right side) and click the Add button to add a new prescription. 

1. Click the Fx per week drop-down and select a value (e.g., 4). 

1. Enter a value in the Number of Fx input (e.g., 1). 

1. Click the Energy drop-down and select a value (e.g., 50). 

1. Click the TDF drop-down and select a value (e.g., 94). 

1. Enter a value in the Dose Per Fx [cGy] input (e.g., 100). 

