UID: TC-H10SG-772
TITLE: Physics - Layout - UI Test Case
STATEMENT: >>>
This test case verifies the layout and user interface components of the Physics. It validates that all UI elements are properly displayed and arranged according to specifications.
<<<
STEPS: >>>
1. Click the Physics tab in the application navigation menu 

2. Verify that the Physics configuration interface loads successfully 

3. Locate and verify the Import from CSV section at the top of the interface displays: 

o A text field/box for file path or file name 

o An upload/import button icon 

