5. Verify the Energy Level [kV] dropdown control is displayed and functional 

6. Verify the interface displays a multi-panel view with the following sections: 

Left Panel - Magnetometer Corrections: 

• Correction Matrix subsection with: 

o Back [mA/μT] fields: CMB 1,1 | CMB 1,2 | CMB 1,3 | CMB 2,1 | CMB 2,2 | CMB 2,3 

o Front [mA/μT] fields: CMF 1,1 | CMF 1,2 | CMF 1,3 | CMF 2,1 | CMF 2,2 | CMF 2,3 

• Reference Field subsection with: 

o Back [mA/μT] fields: RFB 1,1 | RFB 2,1 | RFB 3,1 

o Front [mA/μT] fields: RFF 1,1 | RFF 2,1 | RFF 3,1 

Right Panel - Upper Section - Coils: 

• X Coil [mA] field 

• Y Coil [mA] field 

• Focus [mA] field 

Right Panel - Middle Section - Heater current: 

• Heater Current [mA] field 

Right Panel - Lower Section - Dose Rate: 

• Dose Rate [cGy/Min] field 

1. Verify that all input fields are editable and accept numeric values 

2. Verify that action buttons are present at the bottom right: 

o Approve button 

o Save button 

