• 

Import from CSV control is visible with text field and upload button 

• Applicator Type dropdown is functional and displays available applicator options 

• Energy Level [kV] dropdown is functional and displays available energy levels 

• Multi-panel layout displays all four configuration sections: Magnetometer Corrections, Coils, Heater current, and Dose Rate 

• Magnetometer Corrections panel includes both Correction Matrix (12 fields) and Reference Field (6 fields) subsections 

• Coils section displays three input fields (X Coil, Y Coil, Focus) 

• Heater current section displays one input field 

• Dose Rate section displays one input field 

• All fields are clearly labeled with appropriate units of measurement 

• All numeric input fields are editable 

• Approve and Save buttons are visible and accessible at the bottom
<<<
